{
  "info": {
    "name": "Three Happy Kids - API",
    "_postman_id": "3d6b1a2e-8f2d-4c7a-9f1a-thk-api-collection",
    "description": "Colección para probar HappyKids a través de API/ (puerto 3001), que reenvía las solicitudes al backend principal (puerto 3000) bajo `/api/v1`. Autenticación JWT emitida por el backend mediante `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Login y registro guardan el token automáticamente en la variable de colección `token`.\n\nLos roles/permisos se validan en `backend/src/middleware/role.js`. Las solicitudes con archivos usan `multipart/form-data` (campos `imagen`, `foto` o `evidencia`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiBase", "value": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoriaId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tallaId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "colorId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "documentTypeId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "registeredEmail", "value": "juan.perez@example.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "registeredDocument", "value": "1000000000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "resetToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "activityUserId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "activityId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "activityUserId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "activityId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "providerId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "purchaseId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "purchaseDetailId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "noveltyId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Root",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Estado de la API",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": [""] },
            "description": "Ruta raíz fuera de `/api/v1`. Responde `{ success, message }` si el servidor está arriba."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health check (DB)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/health", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "Ejecuta `SELECT 1` contra MySQL. 200 `{ ok: true }` si conecta, 503 `{ ok: false, error }` si no."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios (Auth)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar tipos de documento",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && body.documentTypes && body.documentTypes[0]) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('documentTypeId', String(body.documentTypes[0].id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/tipos-documento", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["tipos-documento"] },
            "description": "Público. Devuelve los tipos de documento activos que requiere el registro."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('registeredEmail', `juan.perez.${Date.now()}@example.com`);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('registeredDocument', String(Date.now()));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  if (body.user && body.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_usuario\": \"Juan Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"{{registeredEmail}}\",\n  \"primer_nombre\": \"Juan\",\n  \"primer_apellido\": \"Perez\",\n  \"numero_documento\": \"{{registeredDocument}}\",\n  \"id_tipo_documento\": {{documentTypeId}},\n  \"password\": \"secreto123\",\n  \"confirmar_password\": \"secreto123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/registro", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["registro"] },
            "description": "Crea un cliente. Ejecuta antes `Listar tipos de documento`, que guarda automáticamente `documentTypeId`. El registro requiere nombre de usuario, email, nombre/apellido, número y tipo de documento, y contraseña confirmada. 201 devuelve `user` + `token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  if (body.user && body.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{registeredEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"secreto123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/login", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["login"] },
            "description": "Autentica y devuelve `{ user, token }`. El token JWT expira en 8h e incluye `roles` y `permissions`. Guarda el token en la variable de colección `token` para las demás peticiones. 401 si credenciales inválidas, 403 si el usuario está inactivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Solicitar recuperación de contraseña",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{registeredEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/recuperar-contrasena", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["recuperar-contrasena"] },
            "description": "Público, con límite de solicitudes por IP. Responde 202 con un mensaje genérico; el backend envía el enlace por correo si la cuenta existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Restablecer contraseña",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"nuevaClave123\",\n  \"confirmar_password\": \"nuevaClave123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/restablecer-contrasena", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["restablecer-contrasena"] },
            "description": "Público, con límite de intentos por IP. Pega en `resetToken` el token recibido por correo; el enlace expira y solo puede usarse una vez."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/me", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["me"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT. Devuelve el perfil del usuario autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar mi foto de perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "foto", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/me/foto", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["me", "foto"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT. `multipart/form-data`, campo `foto` (jpg/png/webp/gif, máx 5MB). Devuelve la nueva ruta `fotoPerfil`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Productos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar productos públicos",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos-publicos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["productos-publicos"] },
            "description": "Público, sin autenticación. Lista productos activos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle producto público",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos-publicos/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["productos-publicos", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{productId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Público. 404 si no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar colores",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/colores", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["colores"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:read`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar productos (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["productos"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:read`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle producto (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["productos", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{productId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:read`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "nombre", "value": "Camiseta estampada", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "descripcion", "value": "Camiseta de algodón 100%", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "precioCompra", "value": "10000", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "precioVenta", "value": "19900", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "marca", "value": "Happy Kids", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idCategoria", "value": "{{categoriaId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idTalla", "value": "{{tallaId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idColor", "value": "{{colorId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stock", "value": "50", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stockMinimo", "value": "5", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "estado", "value": "Activo", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "imagen", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["productos"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:write`. `multipart/form-data`, `imagen` obligatoria (jpg/png/webp/gif, máx 5MB). `precioCompra` es opcional; `precioVenta`, `idCategoria`, `idTalla`, `idColor`, `stock` y `stockMinimo` son obligatorios. `estado` en `Activo|Inactivo` (default `Activo`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Editar producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "nombre", "value": "Camiseta estampada", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "descripcion", "value": "Camiseta de algodón 100%", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "precioCompra", "value": "10000", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "precioVenta", "value": "21900", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "marca", "value": "Happy Kids", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idCategoria", "value": "{{categoriaId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idTalla", "value": "{{tallaId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "idColor", "value": "{{colorId}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stock", "value": "40", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "stockMinimo", "value": "5", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "estado", "value": "Activo", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "imagen", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["productos", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{productId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:write`. Mismos campos que crear; `imagen` es opcional (si se omite se conserva la actual)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desactivar producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/productos/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["productos", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{productId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero o permiso `productos:write`. Borrado lógico: pasa `estado` a `Inactivo`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pedidos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar todos los pedidos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/pedidos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["pedidos"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT y rol administrador."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear pedido",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 123 #45-67\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"Bogotá\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3001234567\",\n                \"pago\": \"efectivo\",\n  \"productos\": [\n    { \"id\": {{productId}}, \"cantidad\": 2 }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/pedidos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["pedidos"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT y permiso `comprar`. `pago` acepta `efectivo`, `transferencia`, `nequi` o `daviplata`; el teléfono debe tener 10 dígitos. `productos` es un arreglo no vacío. 409 si no hay stock suficiente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar estado de pedido",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n                \"estado\": \"Cancelado\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/pedidos/:id/estado",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["pedidos", ":id", "estado"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{orderId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT y rol administrador. El backend principal actualmente permite cancelar con `estado: \"Cancelado\"`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis pedidos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/mis-pedidos", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["mis-pedidos"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero/mensajero/cliente o permiso `pedidos:own:read`. Devuelve los pedidos del usuario autenticado."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Administración de Usuarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios administrativos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/usuarios", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["usuarios"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `usuarios:read`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear usuario administrativo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "nombre", "value": "Ana", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "apellido", "value": "Gómez", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "correo", "value": "ana.gomez@example.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "telefono", "value": "3009876543", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "secreto123", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "rol", "value": "Bodeguero", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "foto", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/usuarios", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["usuarios"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `usuarios:write`. `rol` debe ser uno de: `Administrador`, `Bodeguero`, `Mensajero`. `foto` es opcional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Editar usuario administrativo",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Gómez\",\n  \"correo\": \"ana.gomez@example.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3009876543\",\n  \"password\": \"\",\n  \"rol\": \"Bodeguero\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/usuarios/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{userId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `usuarios:write`. `password` es opcional (déjalo vacío/omítelo para no cambiarla; si se envía, mínimo 6 caracteres)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar estado de usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"activo\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/usuarios/:id/estado",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", ":id", "estado"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{userId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `usuarios:write`. `activo` es booleano. No se puede desactivar el propio usuario autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar usuario administrativo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/usuarios/:id",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{userId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `usuarios:write`. No se puede eliminar el propio usuario autenticado."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dashboard",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/dashboard", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["dashboard"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador o permiso `dashboard:read`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catálogo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar categorías",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/categorias", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["categorias"] },
            "description": "Público, sin autenticación. Lista categorías activas."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Historial de inventario por producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiBase}}/inventario/:id/historial",
              "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
              "path": ["inventario", ":id", "historial"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "{{productId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar movimiento de inventario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": {{productId}},\n  \"tipo\": \"entrada\",\n  \"cantidad\": 10,\n  \"motivo\": \"Reposición de stock\",\n  \"referencia\": \"OC-0001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/inventario/movimiento", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["inventario", "movimiento"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero. `tipo` en `entrada|salida|ajuste`. `cantidad` > 0. `referencia` y `motivo` opcionales. 400 si no hay stock suficiente para una `salida`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar actividad de inventario",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiBase}}/inventario/actividad", "host": ["{{apiBase}}"], "path": ["inventario", "actividad"] },
            "description": "Requiere JWT + rol administrador/bodeguero. Admite filtros opcionales `usuarioId`, `rol`, `categoria`, `evento`, `desde` y `hasta` (fechas `YYYY-MM-DD`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear reporte de actividad",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
